    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「……え？　『漆黒の晩餐って聞いてたから、もっと禍々しい料理が来るかと思ってた』だって？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 10,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 484
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「浅はかだな。見た目ではない、心の問題だ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「肉じゃがも、肉とじゃがいもだけでできている料理ではない」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「ボクの堕天使の力も、目に見えない要素としてこのお粥に入っているんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 10,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 484
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「詭弁に思えるなら、それはそれでいい。でも、優しい弟くんのことだ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「きっと馬鹿馬鹿しいと思っていても、信じてくれるのだろう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 10,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 484
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「アンジーもそうだったよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 10,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 484
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「ボクのこの性格は、とうてい周囲の人間からは受け入れられるものではなかった」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「だけど、アンジーだけは、そんなボクのことを、ちゃんと受け入れてくれた、信じてくれた」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「いくら礼を尽くしても、返せないくらいの温かさをくれた」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 10,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 484
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「だからボクは、少しずつ、周りの人たちにその温かさを返していくつもりだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「軽音部のみんなや、弟くん。他にも、たくさんの人に、な」"
